|desc=
Set up some cunning contingency plans in case of death.

If you die you will have the option to raise back from the dead once, by becoming a [[Ghoul|ghoul]] or a [[Skeleton|skeleton]] (you can choose which).

When rising this way you will keep access to your racial tree and gain access to the ghoul or skeleton racial tree with 2 levels of each talent already learnt.

As an undead, you will no longer be able to use infusions.

If you choose to become a skeleton, the [[Re-assemble (talent)|Re-assemble]] talent will consider that you already used your resurrection.
}}
===Notes===
*Infusions you already have are not removed, but you can no longer use them.
*Your life rating is replaced: 12 as a skeleton, 14 as a ghoul.
*You do not gain the stat bonuses that characters born as a ghoul or skeleton have.

